{"branch":"남외점","html":"<section id=\"selected-directions\" class=\"km-directions\" aria-labelledby=\"selected-directions-title\" data-km-branch=\"남외점\"><h3 id=\"selected-directions-title\">찾아오시는 길</h3><p class=\"km-intro\">남외점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"km-map\" data-state=\"waiting\"><iframe data-km-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/maps/39sbhmeiawh.htm\" title=\"남외점 카카오 지도\" width=\"800\" height=\"398\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe><p class=\"km-map-status\">카카오 지도</p></div><div class=\"km-details\"><dl><dt>주소</dt><dd>울산 중구 남외3길 15 남외프라자 401호</dd></dl><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 정류장</h4><ul><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">1</span>푸르지오아파트</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">2</span>푸르지오아파트</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">3</span>삼환나우빌</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">4</span>삼환나우빌</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">5</span>남외중학교앞</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">6</span>남외중학교앞</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">7</span>동천야외물놀이장</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">8</span>동천야외물놀이장</li></ul></section><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 버스</h4><ul class=\"km-buses\"><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0102\">지선</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>중구01</span><span>중구01(지원1)</span><span>중구02(지원1)(골드클래스-홈플러스중구점)</span><span>중구02(지원1)(래미안-골드클래스)</span><span>중구01(지원2)</span><span>중구04(농수산물유통센터정문-농수산물유통센터정문)</span><span>중구04(농수산물유통센터정문-현대백화점정문)</span><span>중구04(현대백화점정문-농수산물유통센터정문)</span></span></li></ul></section><p class=\"km-traffic-note\">주변 교통 정보는 제공된 카카오맵 약도 기준입니다. 노선과 정차 여부는 운행 상황에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</p></div></section>"}